// Source only. See `../extraction/tsconfig.build.json` for why this pair of configs exists.
//
// **No `references`, deliberately.** `tsconfig.json` references `../extraction` because
// `test/documents.test.ts` imports it — a test-only edge. Nothing in `src` does, so the build graph
// for source alone does not include extraction, and saying otherwise would compile a package this
// one does not need in order to produce its own `dist`.
{
  "extends": "./tsconfig.json",
  "include": ["src/**/*.ts"],
  "references": []
}
